<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Repair Details</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #333;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }
    .header {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .details {
      background-color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 15px;
    }
    .details p {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="header">Dear <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,</p>

    <p>Thank you for choosing us for your vehicle service. Below are the details of your recent repair:</p>

    <div class="details">
      <p><strong>Repair Code:</strong> {{repairCode}}</p>
      <p><strong>Vehicle Number:</strong> {{licensePlate}}</p>
      {{#if vehicleMakeModel}}
      <p><strong>Make & Model:</strong> {{vehicleMakeModel}}</p>
      {{/if}}
      <p><strong>Job Description:</strong> {{jobName}}</p>
      <p><strong>Total Amount:</strong> Rs. {{total}}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>We appreciate your business and look forward to serving you again.</p>
      <p>Drive safe and see you next time!</p>
      <p><em>MC - Auto Service Team</em></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
